{'symbol': 'TRV', 'date': '2022-11-21 09:00:00', 'title': 'TRAVELERS INSTITUTE AND CAMBRIDGE MOBILE TELEMATICS RELEASE EDUCATIONAL GUIDE TO HELP CURB DISTRACTED DRIVING', 'text': "HARTFORD, CONN. & CAMBRIDGE, MASS.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE TRAVELERS INSTITUTE, THE PUBLIC POLICY DIVISION OF THE TRAVELERS COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: TRV), TODAY RELEASED “ EVERY SECOND MATTERS®: REDUCING DISTRACTED DRIVING, ONE VOICE AT A TIME,” AN EDUCATIONAL GUIDE PUBLISHED IN PARTNERSHIP WITH CAMBRIDGE MOBILE TELEMATICS (CMT), THE WORLD'S LARGEST TELEMATICS COMPANY."}